// Editable workflow support: rl/continuous.hpp
// datamunge::nn port of tflow_examples src/common/rl/continuous.h.
// Pieces shared by the continuous-control examples: config, deterministic
// and Gaussian actors, tanh-squashed sampling with its log-density
// correction, state-action critics, and deterministic evaluation. Actions
// inside the networks live in [-1, 1]; the environment's bounds are applied
// at the boundary with ScaleAction.
//
// Changes from the TF version: the networks are eager functions of a
// ParameterStore and a tensor (calling one twice with the same store and
// name shares its weights, as nn::Params did), NormalNoise returns an
// nn::Tensor, and the TF hardware options are accepted and ignored except
// threads=N, which sets nn's thread count.


// Editable workflow support: rl/dqn_common.hpp
// datamunge::nn port of tflow_examples src/common/rl/dqn_common.h.
// Pieces shared by the DQN-family examples: hyper-parameters, the epsilon
// schedule, a training monitor, Q-value heads (plain / dueling), greedy
// evaluation, the C51 distribution projection, and Adam with global-norm
// clipping (tflow's nn::Adam).
//
// Changes from the TF version: the TF hardware options (device=, threads=,
// xla=) are accepted and ignored, since nn runs eagerly on the CPU; QHead
// builds on a ParameterStore and returns a tensor instead of adding graph
// nodes; the noisy-network head (nn::NoisyDense) is not included, because
// datamunge::nn has no noisy layer yet.


